  - murder
  - why me
  secretInformation: "He\u2019s hiding that the case is personal for Gwen \u2014
    one of the victims has ties to her past."
  knownEvidence:
  - "Initial autopsy report\u201D, \u201C911 call from maid\u201D, \u201CHotel security
